      "description": "Front elevation of suspension insulator with upper and lower end fittings and weathered housing. Dimensions: 19,2(+1,6/0) — width of the upper connection feature at the top fitting; 20,5 — vertical dimension at the top fitting area; Ø90 — diameter of the upper housing/profile region; Н=5 and L=2 — vertical reference heights spanning parts of the insulator body (exact endpoints ambiguous); Ø165 — diameter of the wide lower shed; Ø17(+1,3/0) — bore of the lower end fitting; 16(+0,5/-1,1) — width of a hatched cross-section detail of the end fitting shown beside the drawing.",
